  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Browser evidence is now recorded as the run's own widgets, attributed to the step and the attempt that produced them. The pack's own failure folder is gone, so anything that read that folder should read the run's output instead. A paused run can also be asked to photograph every session it has open. Requires TestFramework.Core 0.5.0 and TestFramework.Config 0.3.0.",
